        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The vanished knights, and the ancient castle twisted into another world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/a9af32a8bf1931afc59c902aaf2ef9d1.avif?t=1766128898\" width=1000 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The radiant, glorious empire of Yurationus.</i><br><i>It was an age of peace, but a tragic incident occurred at a fortress on the empire’s frontier.</i><br><i>The lord of the castle went mad and summoned demons, countless people were sacrificed,</i><br><i>and news of the disaster finally reached the imperial capital.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Divine King Lenas immediately dispatched four knights and their order,</i><br><i>the pride of the empire – but every one of them disappeared.</i><br><i>In the end, the last holy knight, Enoch, and the church sister, Rebecca,</i><br><i>set out to uncover the truth.</i><br><i>The time given to them is only 30 days…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll dash through the castle, find hidden power-ups and items, and challenge powerful bosses – it sticks faithfully to the core formula of a classic Metroidvania.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The in-game 30 days are more than enough time. <strong>This game does not demand a frantic time attack.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The real core of the game is how you manage the changing risks and rewards as time passes.</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Castle with Two Faces: Day and Night</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are doors that open <strong>only</strong> during the day, and others that open <strong>only</strong> at night. They’re marked on the map, so try visiting them at the right time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, taking the risk of going out at night to look for shortcuts or farming souls to level up can actually pay off more in the long run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But if you die, it’s all over!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.webm?t=1766128898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.mp4?t=1766128898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/8a94ae472cb9377970860c4e69a7ebf2.webp?t=1766128898\" width=32 height=32 /></span>  While the sun is up, you can explore relatively safely. Use that time to expand your map and move around boldly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/73cb4ea23cc60399ed1a033f911d0454.webp?t=1766128898\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Once it gets dark, stronger enemies begin to appear and the danger level rises. Return to your base quickly and get ready for tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/a801d4b034aafdc8bce47195ac89a320.webp?t=1766128898\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>When complete darkness falls, an indescribable malice takes over the castle.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changes by Date</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass, every enemy lurking in the castle gradually grows stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only do their appearances change – they may gain new abilities, and even their attack patterns can change.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/5d31bac03fde5fcf83fd6b6a912b3997.apng?t=1766128898\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/5d31bac03fde5fcf83fd6b6a912b3997.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1766128898\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7d61f43122c00e5855248ad3fb2777e0.apng?t=1766128898\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7d61f43122c00e5855248ad3fb2777e0.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1766128898\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/d6c400a0606141dc7ea26f0ceecaa1ed.apng?t=1766128898\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/d6c400a0606141dc7ea26f0ceecaa1ed.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1766128898\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7c6878a3fea506bea14d31d3ca5206e7.apng?t=1766128898\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7c6878a3fea506bea14d31d3ca5206e7.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purify the Abandoned Chapels!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebecca can purify abandoned chapels and turn them into bases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the purification is complete, you’ll have to protect Rebecca from the waves of enemies that keep coming!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.webm?t=1766128898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/26ea95f081f637c3a40986196dfd538a.mp4?t=1766128898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by finding abandoned chapels and moving your base through purification can you explore deeper into the castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once a chapel has been purified, you can use transport to warp there instantly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 <strong>A Vast Gothic Castle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From corridors to underground waterways, spires, and otherworldly spaces—run through a castle that’s both beautiful and eerie, and discover hidden items and secret shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Story-Driven</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the missing knights and listen to their stories. You’ll follow the process of uncovering the truth behind the tragedy that occurred at this castle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌓 <strong>Changes Over Time</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out your day while looking at the map. Actively explore during the daytime, then return safely to your base at night and get ready for tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Five Unique Weapons</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain five distinct weapons, each with its own personality, and choose the one that fits your play style to upgrade and grow stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Collect Bibles and Stellastones</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Bibles and Stellastones scattered throughout the castle to unlock Enoch’s abilities and wield powerful holy magic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😈 <strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, no Metroidvania is complete without boss fights! Take on mighty bosses and savor the thrill of victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Defense &amp; Purification</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abandoned chapels and purify them. A defense mode, where you must protect Sister Rebecca from demons attacking from all sides, adds even more tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
