 marked on the map, so try visiting them at the right time.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, taking the risk of going out at night to look for shortcuts or farming souls to level up can actually pay off more in the long run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But if you die, it’s all over!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.webm?t=1766128898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/f1008bd313c1dbd88c081e09b8cea10d.mp4?t=1766128898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/8a94ae472cb9377970860c4e69a7ebf2.webp?t=1766128898\" width=32 height=32 /></span>  While the sun is up, you can explore relatively safely. Use that time to expand your map and move around boldly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/73cb4ea23cc60399ed1a033f911d0454.webp?t=1766128898\" width=32 height=32 /></span> Once it gets dark, stronger enemies begin to appear and the danger level rises. Return to your base quickly and get ready for tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/a801d4b034aafdc8bce47195ac89a320.webp?t=1766128898\" width=32 height=32 /></span> <strong>When complete darkness falls, an indescribable malice takes over the castle.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changes by Date</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass, every enemy lurking in the castle gradually grows stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only do their appearances change – they may gain new abilities, and even their attack patterns can change.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/5d31bac03fde5fcf83fd6b6a912b3997.apng?t=1766128898\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/5d31bac03fde5fcf83fd6b6a912b3997.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1766128898\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7d61f43122c00e5855248ad3fb2777e0.apng?t=1766128898\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/7d61f43122c00e5855248ad3fb2777e0.poster.avif?t=1766128898\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=120 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/de22441a1dd81b2b31fefb7af6aa3900.webp?t=1766128898\" width=50 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889740/extras/d6c400a0606141dc7ea26f0ceecaa1ed.apng?t=1766128898\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste